8.1 178.2,90.0 179.9,92.0 181.6,94.1 183.2,96.3 184.9,98.7 186.6,101.2 188.2,103.7 189.9,106.4 191.5,109.2 193.2,112.2 194.9,115.2 196.5,118.3 198.2,121.6 199.8,125.0 201.5,128.5 203.2,132.1 204.8,135.8 206.5,139.7 208.2,143.6 209.8,147.7 211.5,151.9 213.1,156.2 214.8,160.6 216.5,165.1 218.1,169.7 219.8,166.6 221.5,161.8 223.1,156.8 224.8,151.7 226.4,146.5 228.1,141.2 229.8,135.7 231.4,130.2 233.1,124.5 234.7,118.7 236.4,112.8 238.1,106.8 239.7,100.6 241.4,94.4 243.1,88.0 244.7,81.6 246.4,75.0 248.0,68.3 249.7,61.5 251.4,54.5 253.0,47.5 254.7,40.3 256.3,33.0 258.0,25.6 259.7,18.1 261.3,10.5 263.0,2.8 264.7,-5.1 266.3,-13.0' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='20.0,49.1 150.0,49.1 280.0,49.1' fill='none' stroke='#f0a30a' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='47.4' cy='49.1' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='3.4' y='43.1'>(−3,5)</text><circle cx='252.6' cy='49.1' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='258.6' y='43.1'>(3,5)</text><text x='225.3' y='34.6' fill='#f0a30a' font-size='10'>y = 5</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 170.6H294.0M150.0 204.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='47.4' y1='167.6' x2='47.4' y2='173.6' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='44.4' y='184.6' font-size='10'>-3</text><line x1='81.6' y1='167.6' x2='81.6' y2='173.6' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='78.6' y='184.6' font-size='10'>-2</text><line x1='115.8' y1='167.6' x2='115.8' y2='173.6' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='112.8' y='184.6' font-size='10'>-1</text><line x1='184.2' y1='167.6' x2='184.2' y2='173.6' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='181.2' y='184.6' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='218.4' y1='167.6' x2='218.4' y2='173.6' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='215.4' y='184.6' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='252.6' y1='167.6' x2='252.6' y2='173.6' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='249.6' y='184.6' font-size='10'>3</text><line x1='147.0' y1='122.0' x2='153.0' y2='122.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='134.0' y='126.0' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='147.0' y1='73.4' x2='153.0' y2='73.4' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='134.0' y='77.4' font-size='10'>4</text></svg></div><p>El recinto es simétrico respecto de \\(OY\\). Separo en \\(x=2\\):</p>\\[A=2\\left[\\int_0^2\\bigl(5-(4-x^2)\\bigr)dx+\\int_2^3\\bigl(5-(x^2-4)\\bigr)dx\\right]=2\\left[\\Bigl[x+\\frac{x^3}3\\Bigr]_0^2+\\Bigl[9x-\\frac{x^3}3\\Bigr]_2^3\\right]\\]\\[=2\\left[\\frac{14}3+\\left(18-\\frac{46}3\\right)\\right]=2\\left(\\frac{14}3+\\frac83\\right)=\\frac{44}3\\]<div class='res'>Área \\(=\\dfrac{44}3\\approx14{,}67\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"funciones","tipo":"rep","apartados":"a"},{"tema":"integ","tipo":"area","apartados":"b"}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2015-SEPTIEMBRE.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2015-septiembre-7","n":7,"num":3,"bloque":"Opción B","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Considera el siguiente sistema de ecuaciones \\[\\begin{cases}2x+y+(\\alpha-1)z=\\alpha-1\\\\x-\\alpha y-3z=1\\\\x+y+2z=2\\alpha-2\\end{cases}\\]","apartados":["(1 p.) Resuelve el sistema para \\(\\alpha=1\\).","(1,5 p.) Determina, si existe, el valor de \\(\\alpha\\) para el que \\((x,y,z)=(1,-3,\\alpha)\\) es la única solución del sistema dado."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Con \\(\\alpha=1\\):</p>\\[\\begin{cases}2x+y=0\\\\x-y-3z=1\\\\x+y+2z=0\\end{cases}\\]<p>Lo resuelvo por la regla de Cramer<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Cramer: si \\(|A|\\neq0\\), cada incógnita es el cociente entre el determinante que resulta de sustituir su columna por la de los términos independientes y el determinante \\(|A|\\) de la matriz de coeficientes.</i>:</p>\\[|A|=\\begin{vmatrix}2&1&0\\\\1&-1&-3\\\\1&1&2\\end{vmatrix}=-3\\]\\[x=\\frac{\\begin{vmatrix}0&1&0\\\\1&-1&-3\\\\0&1&2\\end{vmatrix}}{-3}=\\frac{-2}{-3}=\\frac{2}{3}\\]\\[y=\\frac{\\begin{vmatrix}2&0&0\\\\1&1&-3\\\\1&0&2\\end{vmatrix}}{-3}=\\frac{4}{-3}=- \\frac{4}{3}\\]\\[z=\\frac{\\begin{vmatrix}2&1&0\\\\1&-1&1\\\\1&1&0\\end{vmatrix}}{-3}=\\frac{-1}{-3}=\\frac{1}{3}\\]<div class='res'>\\(x=\\dfrac23,\\ y=-\\dfrac43,\\ z=\\dfrac13\\)</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>Comprobación en la 3.ª: \\(\\frac23-\\frac43+\\frac23=0\\) ✓.</i></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'><p><b>Que </b>\\((1,-3,\\alpha)\\)<b> sea solución.</b> Sustituyo:</p>\\[\\begin{cases}2-3+(\\alpha-1)\\alpha=\\alpha-1\\\\1+3\\alpha-3\\alpha=1\\\\1-3+2\\alpha=2\\alpha-2\\end{cases}\\iff\\begin{cases}\\alpha^2-2\\alpha=0\\\\1=1\\\\2\\alpha-2=2\\alpha-2\\end{cases}\\]<p>Es solución si \\(\\alpha=0\\) o \\(\\alpha=2\\).</p><p><b>Que sea la única:</b> el sistema tiene que ser compatible determinado, \\(|A|\\neq0\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>Rouché-Frobenius: el sistema es compatible si y solo si \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=\\operatorname{rg}A^*\\); determinado si ese rango es el número de incógnitas, indeterminado si es menor.</i>. Por la regla de Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de los dos triángulos con un lado paralelo a ella (en verde) y se restan los de la diagonal secundaria y sus dos triángulos (en rojo).<span style='display:block;margin:6px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 206 106' width='100%' style='max-width:230px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif'><text x='0' y='30' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><text x='0' y='86' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><polygon points='26,10 41,25 56,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='41' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='56' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><polygon points='103,10 118,25 88,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='118' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='88' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='103' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='180,10 150,25 165,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='150' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='165' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='180' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='56,66 41,81 26,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='26' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='56' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='41' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='88,66 118,81 103,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='103' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i>:</p>\\[|A|=\\begin{vmatrix}2&1&\\alpha-1\\\\1&-\\alpha&-3\\\\1&1&2\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(- 4 \\alpha-3+\\alpha - 1\\bigr)-\\bigl(- \\alpha^{2} + \\alpha-6+2\\bigr)\\]\\[=\\alpha^2-4\\alpha=\\alpha(\\alpha-4)\\]<p>Con \\(\\alpha=0\\), \\(|A|=0\\): habría infinitas soluciones. Con \\(\\alpha=2\\), \\(|A|=4-8=-4\\neq0\\): solución única.</p><div class='res'>\\(\\alpha=2\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"sistemas","tipo":"res","apartados":"a"},{"tema":"sistemas","tipo":"disc","apartados":"b"}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2015-SEPTIEMBRE.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2015-septiembre-8","n":8,"num":4,"bloque":"Opción B","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Considera el plano \\(\\pi\\) de ecuación \\(mx+5y+2z=0\\) y la recta \\(r\\) dada por \\(\\dfrac{x+1}3=\\dfrac yn=\\dfrac{z-1}2\\).","apartados":["(1 p.) Calcula \\(m\\) y \\(n\\) en el caso en el que la recta \\(r\\) es perpendicular al plano \\(\\pi\\).","(1,5 p.) Calcula \\(m\\) y \\(n\\) en el caso en el que la recta \\(r\\) está contenida en el plano \\(\\pi\\)."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'><p>\\(r\\) pasa por \\((-1,0,1)\\) con \\(\\vec d=(3,n,2)\\); \\(\\vec n_\\pi=(m,5,2)\\). La recta es perpendicular al plano si \\(\\vec d\\parallel\\vec n_\\pi\\)<i class='n' data-t='why'>Si la recta es perpendicular al plano, su dirección es la del vector normal.</i>:</p>\\[\\frac3m=\\frac n5=\\frac22=1\\iff m=3,\\ n=5\\]<div class='res'>\\(m=3\\), \\(n=5\\)</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'><p>La recta está contenida en el plano si su director es perpendicular al normal y uno de sus puntos está en el plano:</p>\\[(-1,0,1)\\in\\pi:\\ -m+0+2=0\\iff m=2\\]\\[\\vec d\\cdot\\vec n_\\pi=3m+5n+4=0\\iff6+5n+4=0\\iff n=-2\\]<div class='res'>\\(m=2\\), \\(n=-2\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"geom","tipo":"pos","apartados":"a, b"}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2015-SEPTIEMBRE.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"}]}